WEBVTT

00:06.600 --> 00:12.005
Every five seconds, this satellite takes a picture, and has forty milliseconds to understand it.

00:12.400 --> 00:16.563
Its power, its memory and its time are all limited, and all changing.

00:17.600 --> 00:22.866
Adaptive AI usually picks from a cost sheet, written on a developer's laptop.

00:23.800 --> 00:27.893
On the flight board, that sheet was six and a half times too optimistic.

00:31.600 --> 00:33.402
MIZAN weighs every frame.

00:33.402 --> 00:35.277
How deep the network runs.

00:35.277 --> 00:36.863
Whether to run at all.

00:36.863 --> 00:38.232
At what resolution.

00:38.800 --> 00:42.154
A safety filter can refuse a choice, but never make one.

00:42.154 --> 00:47.126
And every frame, MIZAN measures what the board really took, and corrects the sheet.

00:48.300 --> 00:51.418
Over Tunis, the radio steals the processor.

00:54.800 --> 00:58.435
The twin that trusts its sheet misses sixty-four deadlines.

00:58.435 --> 01:02.255
MIZAN learns the board is busy, steps down, and misses twelve.

01:03.100 --> 01:06.752
When the radio heats the payload, it pauses, and cools.

01:07.900 --> 01:13.375
In eclipse, with one wing stuck, it narrows its menu, then rests, and recovers on its own.

01:14.500 --> 01:16.751
Then another task takes the memory.

01:16.751 --> 01:20.804
The cheapest fixed model no longer fits, and loses every frame.

01:20.804 --> 01:22.477
MIZAN's choice still fits.

01:22.477 --> 01:23.570
It keeps imaging.

01:24.900 --> 01:25.942
And the surprise:

01:25.942 --> 01:29.620
the AI used less than one percent of the satellite's energy.

01:29.620 --> 01:33.911
The lever is when to power the payload, not how deep the network runs.

01:35.300 --> 01:39.374
On the real board, correcting the sheet cut missed deadlines by half.

01:39.374 --> 01:46.459
On scenarios it had never seen, it held ninety-nine and a half percent of the optimum, with no breach in a hundred runs.

01:50.000 --> 01:50.371
MIZAN.

01:50.371 --> 01:53.775
It measures the board it flies on, and keeps measuring.
